WEBVTT

00:01.100 --> 00:04.200
For instance,
even if those arms of yours

00:04.200 --> 00:07.040
Become entwined in chains

00:07.040 --> 00:10.470
For instance,
even if this space we live in

00:10.470 --> 00:14.840
Someday will burn completely down

00:14.840 --> 00:20.980
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

00:22.250 --> 00:26.520
In the shadows of glimmering stars

00:28.320 --> 00:32.590
There is a world governed by darkness

00:34.400 --> 00:38.890
Just one life that is out there

00:40.400 --> 00:45.670
If you keep it entrapped there,
lonely boy

00:46.470 --> 00:52.250
The reason that we met each other here

00:52.250 --> 00:58.590
Must surely exist

00:58.590 --> 01:01.860
For instance,
even if sorrow takes you

01:01.860 --> 01:04.790
And you're about to collapse under it

01:04.790 --> 01:08.130
For instance,
if my chest can become

01:08.130 --> 01:12.500
A power to hold you and keep you there

01:12.500 --> 01:16.900
I'm sure that even
tomorrow we can survive

01:30.620 --> 01:31.890
This planet is...

01:31.890 --> 01:34.260
It seems to be dead.

01:34.260 --> 01:36.060
Captain, let's disembark.

01:36.060 --> 01:39.490
There might be some information
about their operation.

01:40.630 --> 01:44.220
BC, I'm not worried about you,
but the other girls.

02:00.520 --> 02:02.950
They treat others
a little too harshly here.

02:02.950 --> 02:04.180
Right, partner?

02:04.990 --> 02:08.460
Geez, they really don't understand.

02:08.460 --> 02:10.650
Just who do they think is responsible...

02:13.930 --> 02:15.730
Maybe I'm not eating well.

02:17.570 --> 02:19.090
Are you all right?

02:40.220 --> 02:42.050
W-What the hell are you doing?

02:43.090 --> 02:45.090
A clinical check-up.

02:45.090 --> 02:47.130
Don't touch me in weird places.

02:47.130 --> 02:49.660
You seem to be rather spent.

02:49.660 --> 02:51.170
You know...

02:51.170 --> 02:54.300
...when you're out fighting with
women you're gonna get tired.

02:54.300 --> 02:55.890
I'm protecting them.

02:56.840 --> 02:59.810
You're protecting those women?

02:59.810 --> 03:01.280
O-Or rather...

03:01.280 --> 03:03.010
I'm stronger than they are.

03:03.010 --> 03:06.680
Women are, you know, weak and um...

03:06.680 --> 03:08.350
Let's stop talking about women.

03:08.350 --> 03:09.520
What is this?

03:09.520 --> 03:10.790
A game?

03:10.790 --> 03:12.520
Haven't you seen a pulse-meter before?

03:12.520 --> 03:14.360
It doesn't matter if I have.

03:14.360 --> 03:17.330
Organ problems can be fixed in the jacuzzi!

03:17.330 --> 03:18.690
Jacuzzi?

03:28.040 --> 03:30.810
Fighting really damages my hair!

03:30.810 --> 03:32.040
Don't worry.

03:32.040 --> 03:34.710
I'll protect the way you look, Jura.

03:34.710 --> 03:35.780
Thanks.

03:35.780 --> 03:38.770
When my hair isn't set right
I don't feel like fighting as much.

03:40.320 --> 03:43.050
Leader, you want to
lose even more weight?

03:43.050 --> 03:46.150
Excess body fat gets
in the way in combat.

03:46.150 --> 03:47.620
You won't have any breasts left!

03:48.490 --> 03:49.720
No need to worry.

03:49.720 --> 03:51.350
I can take care of myself.

03:52.360 --> 03:54.690
I don't understand humans.

04:07.640 --> 04:10.210
It's mine!

04:10.210 --> 04:11.150
Dita!

04:11.150 --> 04:12.780
That thing's loaded with calories.

04:12.780 --> 04:13.850
It's all right.

04:13.850 --> 04:15.940
He was saying he wasn't eating well!

04:18.950 --> 04:21.050
Heat source response
confirmed on the planet.

04:22.220 --> 04:25.260
I can't tell much
due to a large sandstorm

04:25.260 --> 04:28.460
but the response looks
like an artificial building.

04:28.460 --> 04:29.400
Let's disembark.

04:29.400 --> 04:31.460
We might be able to find something.

04:32.470 --> 04:35.870
Our kitchen is running
really low on supplies.

04:35.870 --> 04:39.770
I guess we'll go about it
the traditional pirates' way.

04:39.770 --> 04:41.280
Thank you very much.

04:41.280 --> 04:43.010
Start monitoring the weather!

04:43.010 --> 04:45.810
We need to figure
out the best time to go.

04:45.810 --> 04:46.800
Roger!

04:50.850 --> 04:53.990
Attention all pilots and crew members.

04:53.990 --> 04:55.560
As part of the away mission,

04:55.560 --> 04:59.630
all members should begin
Vanguard simulations at once.

04:59.630 --> 05:00.630
What?

05:00.630 --> 05:02.560
Women are going in the Van-types?

05:05.030 --> 05:06.430
Sheesh.

05:06.430 --> 05:09.640
I know it's impossible to land
on the planet in the Dreads,

05:09.640 --> 05:13.070
but to pilot men's
Vanguards, of all things.

05:13.070 --> 05:14.600
I don't care what it is.

05:16.010 --> 05:19.080
As long as I can combine
into something wonderful.

05:19.080 --> 05:23.450
If anyone has any questions,
please ask me.

05:23.450 --> 05:27.290
I've had endless training when
I was in the military academy.

05:27.290 --> 05:30.120
You could say when
it comes to Van-types...

05:30.120 --> 05:32.290
What are you doing
down there by yourself?

05:32.290 --> 05:34.490
Sheesh, we're busy
so get out of the way!

05:39.370 --> 05:42.500
I'll make yours all
clean and pretty, Mr. Alien!

05:43.710 --> 05:44.690
Wait!

05:46.870 --> 05:48.030
I made it...

05:49.540 --> 05:51.450
What the hell do
you think you're doing?

05:51.450 --> 05:53.150
A pink Mr. Alien!

05:53.150 --> 05:54.480
How cute!

05:55.650 --> 05:57.280
This girl...

06:00.820 --> 06:05.630
We have a heat response,
but no responses for life-forms.

06:05.630 --> 06:07.200
Hey, could it be that thing...

06:07.200 --> 06:09.200
You mean the razing?

06:09.200 --> 06:10.570
Don't stop monitoring.

06:10.570 --> 06:12.800
We'll head down
when the storm subsides.

06:12.800 --> 06:14.100
- Roger!
- Roger!

06:18.340 --> 06:21.280
- Damn it!
- No!

06:21.280 --> 06:23.750
I can't take this!

06:23.750 --> 06:26.310
Why can't this baby move
around with more elegance?

06:26.310 --> 06:27.350
I quit.

06:27.350 --> 06:28.620
Without permission...

06:28.620 --> 06:29.620
Be quiet.

06:29.620 --> 06:32.250
It looks like I'll need to
be on the bridge as well.

06:32.250 --> 06:33.860
I told you so.

06:33.860 --> 06:36.590
There's no way that women
can control the Van-types.

06:41.430 --> 06:42.420
What?

06:51.710 --> 06:54.610
Are there medical overrides in Mejale?

06:54.610 --> 06:56.480
In cases like this on Tarak,

06:56.480 --> 06:59.280
doctors have the authority
to stop pilots from scrambling.

06:59.280 --> 07:00.310
Do you agree?

07:00.310 --> 07:01.920
No!

07:01.920 --> 07:05.550
Then try switching your field
of view to all directions.

07:05.550 --> 07:07.860
That should lessen
the impact on your body.

07:07.860 --> 07:09.790
Leave me alone.

07:09.790 --> 07:12.060
I won't take help from anyone.

07:12.060 --> 07:14.700
I can overcome any obstacle myself!

07:14.700 --> 07:15.830
Let's see...

07:15.830 --> 07:18.770
How to use the
ten-in-one knife-shield.

07:18.770 --> 07:21.240
Following the will of the pilot...

07:21.240 --> 07:24.530
Hey, simultaneous use with
the electron pulse beam...

07:25.570 --> 07:27.770
- It's possible!
- Idiot.

07:28.780 --> 07:31.580
You'll be doing that
for the rest of your life.

07:31.580 --> 07:32.750
All right?

07:32.750 --> 07:36.420
You'll be combining with me, Jura, next.

07:36.420 --> 07:39.750
I hope you keep that
engraved into your mind.

07:39.750 --> 07:42.020
W-What was that all about?

07:49.800 --> 07:52.230
Your sudden change in pulse,

07:52.230 --> 07:54.270
seems to be from something emotional.

07:54.270 --> 07:56.000
Do you have any idea
where it comes from?

07:57.610 --> 07:59.410
Your diagnosis is wrong.

07:59.410 --> 08:01.580
This is just fatigue, Doctor.

08:01.580 --> 08:05.650
Since you're so adamant about it,
I'd say it's rather serious.

08:05.650 --> 08:07.240
I'm just saying it's fatigue!

08:12.350 --> 08:14.910
Excessive nosiness bothers me.

08:17.690 --> 08:19.730
Why do humans always
overexert themselves?

08:19.730 --> 08:20.930
I don't get it.

08:20.930 --> 08:22.760
That's why they're interesting.

08:22.760 --> 08:24.030
Don't you think so?

08:24.030 --> 08:25.100
Not really.

08:25.100 --> 08:28.570
To go against primal instincts,
holding back desire...

08:28.570 --> 08:32.040
Only humans act like that.

08:32.040 --> 08:34.610
They're rather interesting creatures.

08:34.610 --> 08:37.350
You know, it's not really...

08:37.350 --> 08:38.850
Old hag, are you there?

08:38.850 --> 08:40.410
There's one right here.

08:40.410 --> 08:41.920
What is it, little one?

08:41.920 --> 08:44.150
Don't let them mess with the Van-types!

08:44.150 --> 08:47.360
Sheesh, they're nothing but annoying.

08:47.360 --> 08:47.920
In any case...

08:47.920 --> 08:49.580
- Hey, there you are!
- She's here!

08:51.960 --> 08:52.990
How ironic.

08:52.990 --> 08:57.100
It's become much livelier
since we picked up those men.

08:57.100 --> 08:58.090
Sure...

08:59.200 --> 09:00.600
What is it this time?

09:00.600 --> 09:02.040
Here!

09:02.040 --> 09:05.340
Eat up! You like women's food, right?

09:14.850 --> 09:16.680
W-What are you looking at?

09:16.680 --> 09:19.150
I just want to watch!

09:21.390 --> 09:24.980
When you eat it like that,
it makes me feel so happy!

09:26.430 --> 09:27.990
Pai-check!

09:29.530 --> 09:33.900
And so, they were together
having lunch on a mat alone!

09:33.900 --> 09:38.500
That guy was at Dita's will
with just one boxed lunch!

09:40.340 --> 09:41.470
I see...

09:42.910 --> 09:46.810
Why do I have to cook because of that?

09:46.810 --> 09:48.350
It's so I can combine.

09:48.350 --> 09:51.150
Don't you love me when
I'm beautiful, Barnette?

09:55.460 --> 09:57.390
Here! It's done.

09:57.390 --> 09:59.090
I love you, Barnette!

10:00.730 --> 10:03.160
Let's hurry up and
call him over here.

10:08.900 --> 10:10.930
So this is women's food...

10:19.710 --> 10:20.780
W-What's this?

10:20.780 --> 10:22.720
What are you guys planning to do?

10:26.120 --> 10:28.620
If you combine with me, you can eat it.

10:28.620 --> 10:30.660
T-Then, I don't want it!

10:30.660 --> 10:32.630
It's so good it's to die for.

10:37.430 --> 10:39.500
Are you here, Mr. Alien?

10:39.500 --> 10:41.340
H-Hi... It's you.

10:41.340 --> 10:42.970
Oh, Mr. Pilot.

10:42.970 --> 10:45.740
What's wrong? Your face is...

10:45.740 --> 10:46.830
O-Oh, nothing.

10:47.940 --> 10:48.930
Want some?

10:50.280 --> 10:53.350
N-No, I'll have some another time!

10:53.350 --> 10:54.820
See ya!

10:54.820 --> 10:57.180
Men are strange.

10:58.190 --> 11:02.120
He snuck in here
and was licking the pot.

11:02.120 --> 11:04.230
Ezra, what are you doing here?

11:04.230 --> 11:06.630
I've been craving sour food recently.

11:10.970 --> 11:13.630
The planet surface has stabilized.

11:13.630 --> 11:15.040
This is our only chance!

11:15.040 --> 11:17.030
All pilots, stand by to disembark!

11:20.240 --> 11:22.240
This isn't the time
for this kinda stuff!

11:22.240 --> 11:24.580
Hey, you have to keep your promise!

11:31.350 --> 11:32.750
I won't let things

11:32.750 --> 11:35.880
like women, ruin the image
of my valuable partner!

11:38.760 --> 11:40.450
Damn them all!

11:43.400 --> 11:45.800
I won't let you get away that easily.

11:45.800 --> 11:46.830
No!

11:46.830 --> 11:49.140
Mr. Alien is going to combine with me!

11:49.140 --> 11:50.130
Quiet!

11:51.440 --> 11:52.430
Oh my.

12:25.670 --> 12:26.770
I started out late.

12:26.770 --> 12:28.710
You don't need to overdo it.

12:28.710 --> 12:31.280
Won't they be all
right even without you, Meia?

12:31.280 --> 12:32.580
I can't let that happen!

12:32.580 --> 12:34.220
I have my responsibilities!

12:34.220 --> 12:37.590
But the drop ship is a one-way trip.

12:37.590 --> 12:38.950
There aren't any extras.

12:38.950 --> 12:40.280
What?

12:45.830 --> 12:48.630
There's nothing here.

12:48.630 --> 12:50.770
There's no need for Meia to join us.

12:50.770 --> 12:52.930
Wow, it's all sand!

12:52.930 --> 12:54.140
W-Wait a minute!

12:54.140 --> 12:56.270
Don't go off on...

12:56.270 --> 12:56.930
Mr. Alien!

12:59.170 --> 13:03.480
Come to think of it, this is the
first time I've been on land, too.

13:03.480 --> 13:05.810
Sheesh, this doesn't look too cool.

13:08.020 --> 13:10.420
Hey, why can't we hurry up with it?

13:10.420 --> 13:12.010
Y-You've got to be kidding!

13:13.020 --> 13:14.220
Dita?

13:14.220 --> 13:16.720
Mr. Alien is going to do it with me!

13:16.720 --> 13:18.060
Hey, you!

13:18.060 --> 13:19.960
Who do you think you're talking to?

13:19.960 --> 13:21.330
Anyway, you can't!

13:23.360 --> 13:26.090
That's enough!

13:33.670 --> 13:34.660
What's that?

13:38.610 --> 13:39.940
Mr. Alien!

13:41.150 --> 13:42.450
What is it now?

13:42.450 --> 13:44.320
Their pulses are rising.

13:44.320 --> 13:45.850
It looks like something happened!

13:45.850 --> 13:46.550
Report.

13:46.550 --> 13:49.060
A defense system seems
to have been activated!

13:49.060 --> 13:52.430
The team has been surrounded
by a shield that has sprung up!

13:52.430 --> 13:54.420
Landing party, do you copy?

13:55.130 --> 13:56.130
What is this?

13:56.130 --> 13:57.060
It's no use.

13:57.060 --> 13:58.630
We're completely trapped in here!

13:58.630 --> 14:00.730
Mr. Alien's going to die!

14:00.730 --> 14:02.100
Calm down!

14:02.100 --> 14:03.500
What kind of trap is it?

14:03.500 --> 14:04.640
A-Actually, it's...

14:04.640 --> 14:07.780
The sand is attacking us!

14:07.780 --> 14:09.110
W-What?

14:09.880 --> 14:11.970
W-What is it with this sand?

14:14.920 --> 14:15.920
No!

14:15.920 --> 14:18.080
This sand is a little strange...

14:19.750 --> 14:21.060
What is this?

14:21.060 --> 14:23.160
It seems like it's alive.

14:23.160 --> 14:24.020
Do an analysis.

14:24.020 --> 14:25.010
Roger!

14:34.030 --> 14:35.200
This is Meia.

14:35.200 --> 14:36.100
Where is everyone?

14:36.100 --> 14:37.090
Copy!

14:39.340 --> 14:40.640
She's overexerting herself.

14:43.440 --> 14:46.210
Damn it, what's going on?
I can't move!

14:47.750 --> 14:49.420
Mr. Alien...

14:49.420 --> 14:50.620
Wait a little bit.

14:50.620 --> 14:52.990
I'll save you now.

14:52.990 --> 14:54.150
Don't move so much!

14:54.150 --> 14:55.320
It'll just get harder!

14:55.320 --> 14:56.620
Leave it to me!

15:03.430 --> 15:05.200
All right!

15:05.200 --> 15:07.600
As a reward you
have to do you-know-what.

15:07.600 --> 15:09.840
Are you still saying
stupid stuff like that?

15:09.840 --> 15:13.010
I only combine with your Dreads, right?

15:13.010 --> 15:16.380
How am I supposed to combine
with another Van-type?

15:16.380 --> 15:17.650
You're kidding.

15:17.650 --> 15:21.780
Geez, I never would
have come if I'd known that!

15:38.400 --> 15:39.070
Oh no!

15:39.070 --> 15:40.730
Meia, can you hear me?

15:40.730 --> 15:42.040
Open up your vision!

15:42.040 --> 15:44.370
Look as far away as you can.

15:44.370 --> 15:46.170
Can you hear me, Meia?

15:46.170 --> 15:47.830
He's really nosy...

15:58.790 --> 16:00.120
What is it?

16:06.660 --> 16:09.300
Meia has vanished from the radar!

16:09.300 --> 16:10.060
What?

16:10.060 --> 16:11.870
The crew is confused.

16:11.870 --> 16:13.300
It's a dangerous situation.

16:20.270 --> 16:22.780
I'm... I'm scared.

16:22.780 --> 16:24.350
Jura! Barnette!

16:24.350 --> 16:25.410
Can you hear me?

16:25.410 --> 16:26.750
We've lost Meia!

16:26.750 --> 16:28.050
I want you to search for her!

16:28.050 --> 16:29.720
- Roger!
- Roger!

16:29.720 --> 16:30.980
What's wrong, everyone?

16:32.090 --> 16:34.180
W-What in the world is this?

16:39.090 --> 16:40.760
Someone, help me!

16:40.760 --> 16:42.460
- Damn it!
- No, get away!

16:42.460 --> 16:45.370
What in the world
is going on down there?

16:45.370 --> 16:46.830
The analysis results are in.

16:46.830 --> 16:48.900
Put it up on the monitor.

16:48.900 --> 16:52.210
This square thing has a will
and is controlling the sand...

16:52.210 --> 16:53.610
...apparently.

16:53.610 --> 16:54.880
Just as I thought.

16:54.880 --> 16:57.540
It was a trap that
they had left behind.

17:08.260 --> 17:10.520
Is this a total waste of time?

17:12.930 --> 17:16.160
The sand is copying
the system of the Vanguards!

17:16.160 --> 17:18.320
It's like they're draining
the blood out of us!

17:19.670 --> 17:21.290
Meia, where are you?

17:22.300 --> 17:23.290
Meia!

17:35.450 --> 17:36.440
What?

17:39.120 --> 17:42.660
The self-destruct sequence of
the system has been activated.

17:42.660 --> 17:44.390
300 seconds until detonation!

17:44.390 --> 17:45.990
That's not good.

17:45.990 --> 17:47.980
Landing party, return to the ship now!

17:50.200 --> 17:51.530
Don't say it like it's easy!

17:51.530 --> 17:53.300
If we could, we would've!

17:54.900 --> 17:57.170
Here they come again!

17:57.170 --> 17:57.940
Wait!

17:57.940 --> 17:59.210
That is Meia!

17:59.210 --> 18:01.380
The sand swallowed her
up and is controlling her!

18:01.380 --> 18:02.610
What?

18:02.610 --> 18:04.600
200 seconds until detonation!

18:09.820 --> 18:10.810
Hey!

18:11.890 --> 18:13.550
What are you dozing
off in there for?

18:13.550 --> 18:15.390
Hurry up and get
that stuff off of you!

18:17.890 --> 18:19.030
Stop it.

18:19.030 --> 18:20.930
Don't bother with me.

18:20.930 --> 18:23.200
Don't be so damn selfish!

18:23.200 --> 18:25.070
Even if you do keep pissing me off...

18:25.070 --> 18:27.940
...it'd make me feel like crap
if you died in front of me!

18:27.940 --> 18:30.030
Don't think that
life's just about you!

18:31.040 --> 18:32.870
Damn it... Damn it!

18:34.310 --> 18:36.210
This isn't getting me anywhere...

18:36.210 --> 18:38.470
Think... There's got to be a way...

18:41.880 --> 18:44.320
120 seconds until detonation!

18:44.320 --> 18:47.190
- Landing party!
- I know!

18:55.230 --> 18:56.590
What are you doing?

18:57.830 --> 19:00.000
It's cold. I'm going to freeze!

19:00.000 --> 19:01.260
Freeze?

19:07.140 --> 19:08.510
Amazing!

19:08.510 --> 19:10.370
That's our Mr. Alien!

19:15.850 --> 19:17.890
To think I owe a man a debt now.

19:17.890 --> 19:19.750
Are you an idiot?

19:19.750 --> 19:22.890
This isn't a question
of being a man or a woman!

19:22.890 --> 19:24.950
If you don't want to die,
then grab my hand!

19:26.690 --> 19:28.160
30 seconds left!

19:28.160 --> 19:29.800
All units, hurry up with your retreat!

19:29.800 --> 19:31.060
Come on!

19:38.870 --> 19:39.860
The limit...

19:59.530 --> 20:01.800
All the Vanguards are safe!

20:01.800 --> 20:05.070
We intercepted some data from the planet.

20:05.070 --> 20:06.200
Read it.

20:06.200 --> 20:07.290
Huh?

20:08.300 --> 20:10.240
What's wrong? Didn't you hear me?

20:10.240 --> 20:12.640
I'm sorry. I'll read it now.

20:13.870 --> 20:15.480
This season's harvest items.

20:15.480 --> 20:17.440
Red blood cells, white blood cells,

20:17.440 --> 20:19.580
platelets, lymph cells, etc.

20:19.580 --> 20:21.750
All components in good condition.

20:21.750 --> 20:24.420
This is where the data ends.

20:24.420 --> 20:26.550
Captain! This is...

20:26.550 --> 20:30.120
It looks like the enemy
really wanted to harvest us.

20:30.120 --> 20:35.660
I guess they only think of us
as something like vegetables.

20:35.660 --> 20:38.470
There is one thing that
I have learned from this incident.

20:38.470 --> 20:42.660
It is that we are facing
something truly formidable.

20:49.480 --> 20:51.450
What a disgrace.

20:51.450 --> 20:53.750
To have my life saved by a man.

20:53.750 --> 20:56.340
And of all men...

20:57.180 --> 20:59.380
My head hurts so much...

21:00.450 --> 21:02.220
Maybe I caught a cold.

21:06.190 --> 21:07.630
What's with her?

21:13.100 --> 21:14.770
Pai-check!

21:14.770 --> 21:17.340
I really don't understand
humans after all.

21:17.340 --> 21:19.740
What's going to happen
once you understand them?

21:19.740 --> 21:21.910
What's going to happen now
that you've checked them out?

21:21.910 --> 21:23.710
What a mean robot.

21:23.710 --> 21:25.040
Shut up.

21:32.090 --> 21:37.690
Hey, you realized what the words,

21:37.690 --> 21:43.200
I really wanted to hear are, right?

21:43.200 --> 21:49.440
I was looking at your profile as
you talked about the distant future.

21:49.440 --> 21:59.750
Take me with you to the depths of dreams.

21:59.750 --> 22:02.280
Hey, with all of my body.

22:02.280 --> 22:14.060
A pistol named love shoots
through the center of my chest.

22:14.060 --> 22:25.670
Negotiations and common
sense hold no meaning at all.

22:25.670 --> 22:37.480
Pull the trigger named love and
shoot through my frozen heart.

22:37.480 --> 22:51.350
Pour in your love
to the tips of my fingers.
